        "createdBy" : [ "Carrine Blank" ],
        "definition" : [ "Undefined organic chemical mixture, comprised of ruminal fluid derived from the rumen of a cow, which has been clarified (through the processes of heating/autoclaving and then centrifugation).  Used to cultivate microorganisms." ],
